Gowin IP templates
------------------
Files:  usb/tang_pll_48.v, board/console138k/pll_c27_mod.v, board/console138k/pll_c1485_mod.v and the other
        *_mod.v PLL modules generated by the Gowin IP generator
Source: Gowin Semiconductor Corporation; their headers carry Gowin's copyright notice.  pll_c1485_mod.v
        (dividers as parameters, dynamic MDIV), pll_c48_mod.v and pll_ddr3_mod.v (other settings, a gated
        CLKOUT2) are modified by the Tango authors; a comment above Gowin's header says what changed.

Gowin DDR3 Memory Interface IP (TANGO_VIDEO_DDR3 builds)
Not in this repository: ddr3/tango_ddr3_ip.tcl has the Gowin IDE generate the IP into each build, under the
licence of the user's Gowin EDA installation.  Its configuration follows Sipeed's DDR3 example for the board.

Files:  board/console138k/pll_init.v
Source: Gowin Semiconductor Corporation: the PLL_INIT module of the Gowin EDA IDE (ipcore/PLL_ADV/data/PLL/pll_init.v
        of version V1.9.11.03), copied unchanged; the GW5AST PLLs need it to lock.
